{"id":"1e73231d304a46ec","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-cram-ind-fo.md","title":"多项式资源 CRAM 与有界归纳深度","display":"thm-cram-ind-fo — 多项式资源 CRAM 与有界归纳深度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-cram-ind-fo","aliases":["29-thm-cram-ind-fo"],"display":"thm-cram-ind-fo — 多项式资源 CRAM 与有界归纳深度","depends_on":["[[29-df-cram]]","[[29-df-ind]]","[[29-df-string-structures]]","[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","[[29-df-fo-iteration]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 5.2, p.71, DjVu scan 86","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层与扫描86原图；三项刻画的标准串输入接口为本地展开","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-cram-ind-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-cram-ind-fo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cram-ind-fo — 多项式资源 CRAM 与有界归纳深度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" href=\"?note=0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" title=\"29-df-cram\">29-df-cram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc0d9cb665f96790\" href=\"?note=bc0d9cb665f96790\" title=\"29-df-ind\">29-df-ind</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8abb8daacc5641b\" href=\"?note=e8abb8daacc5641b\" title=\"29-df-string-structures\">29-df-string-structures</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"95fd0348476d19cc\" href=\"?note=95fd0348476d19cc\" title=\"29-df-fo-iteration\">29-df-fo-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 5.2, p.71, DjVu scan 86"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层与扫描86原图；三项刻画的标准串输入接口为本地展开"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\geq1\\;t(n)\\leq t(n+1)\">\\(\\forall n\\geq1\\;t(n)\\leq t(n+1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists c,d\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;t(n)\\leq c(n+1)^d\">\\(\\exists c,d\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;t(n)\\leq c(n+1)^d\\)</span>，并假定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" href=\"?note=0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" title=\"29-df-cram\">29-df-cram</a> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PTC}(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{PTC}(t)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为二进制输入串长度，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil\">\\(\\ell(n)=\\lceil\\log_2(n+1)\\rceil\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]\">\\(\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" href=\"?note=0ec85e1fbf0907b1\" title=\"29-df-cram\">29-df-cram</a> 的固定有限程序、同步优先写入、字长与全判定约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\">\\(\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bc0d9cb665f96790\" href=\"?note=bc0d9cb665f96790\" title=\"29-df-ind\">29-df-ind</a>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\">\\(\\tau=\\tau_{&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT},S}\\)</span>；标准词结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\">\\(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e8abb8daacc5641b\" href=\"?note=e8abb8daacc5641b\" title=\"29-df-string-structures\">29-df-string-structures</a>。有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_w=(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau,&lt;_{|w|})\">\\(U_w=(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau,&lt;_{|w|})\\)</span> 的兼容输入类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal O_\\tau\\)</span>、扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\tau\">\\(E_\\tau\\)</span> 及词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^\\uparrow\">\\(\\tau^\\uparrow\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7174257cf5cba5d4\" href=\"?note=7174257cf5cba5d4\" title=\"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block\">29-df-iterated-quantifier-block</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"95fd0348476d19cc\" href=\"?note=95fd0348476d19cc\" title=\"29-df-fo-iteration\">29-df-fo-iteration</a> 的有序对查询类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 在下式构造为标准有序二进制词的带端点扩张，IND 的深度只对该输入论域取界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\coloneqq E_\\tau(U_w),\\qquad\\mathcal D\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\mid w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\coloneqq E_\\tau(U_w),\\qquad\\mathcal D\\coloneqq\\{\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\mid w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigcup_{a,b\\geq1}\\mathrm{CRAM}[a\\,t,n\\mapsto n^b,b\\,\\ell]\n&amp;=\\left\\{\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\in Q\\}\\ \\middle|\\ Q\\in\\bigcup_{c\\geq1}\\mathrm{IND}[c\\,t,\\tau^\\uparrow;\\mathcal D]\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;=\\left\\{\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid U_w\\in Q\\}\\ \\middle|\\ Q\\in\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\bigcup_{a,b\\geq1}\\mathrm{CRAM}[a\\,t,n\\mapsto n^b,b\\,\\ell]\n&amp;=\\left\\{\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid\\mathfrak A_w^\\uparrow\\in Q\\}\\ \\middle|\\ Q\\in\\bigcup_{c\\geq1}\\mathrm{IND}[c\\,t,\\tau^\\uparrow;\\mathcal D]\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;=\\left\\{\\{w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{+}\\mid U_w\\in Q\\}\\ \\middle|\\ Q\\in\\mathrm{FO}[t,\\tau]\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 5.2，印刷页71、扫描86，三项刻画已核对原图。多项式有界和并行时间可构造前提保留；超多项式推广使用 ITER，不能沿用 IND。本轮补回 FO[t] 第三项，分别沿标准词扩张和有序对拉回为语言，避免直接比较不同类型的查询。</p>\n<p>证明依据：原书 Lemma5.3 用时间标记保存处理器、寄存器、内存的位值，以单调关系累积运行历史，资源均为多项式，故固定元组可以命名全部相关位。Lemma4.25 展开归纳为重复量词块。Lemma5.4 用每个变量赋值对应的处理器并行求值，每个量词步只需常数轮共享内存操作；其计算及寻址值可用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(\\log n)\">\\(O(\\log n)\\)</span> 位，固定有限程序与本地规范化处理器数、输入元数据和输出槽仅改变常数及多项式指数。对单元素输入可在固定有限前缀单独处理。已读这些证明的结构并复核接口对应；未逐式实现原书全部位级模拟或给出 Coq/Lean 机器证明。本地有限测试只检查运行边界，不代替该一般对应论证。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-cram","status":"resolved","id":"0ec85e1fbf0907b1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-cram]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ind","status":"resolved","id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ind]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-string-structures","status":"resolved","id":"e8abb8daacc5641b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-string-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"95fd0348476d19cc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-cram","status":"resolved","id":"0ec85e1fbf0907b1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}$，$\\forall n\\geq1\\;t(n)\\leq t(n+1)$，$\\exists c,d\\geq1\\;\\forall n\\geq1\\;t(n)\\leq c(n+1)^d$，并假定 [[29-df-cram]] 中的 $\\operatorname{PTC}(t)$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-cram","status":"resolved","id":"0ec85e1fbf0907b1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]$ 使用 [[29-df-cram]] 的固定有限程序、同步优先写入、字长与全判定约定；$\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-ind]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ind","status":"resolved","id":"bc0d9cb665f96790","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CRAM}[T,p,w]$ 使用 [[29-df-cram]] 的固定有限程序、同步优先写入、字长与全判定约定；$\\mathrm{IND}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]$ 见 [[29-df-ind]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-string-structures","status":"resolved","id":"e8abb8daacc5641b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"记 $\\tau=\\tau_{<,\\mathrm{BIT},S}$；标准词结构 $\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-string-structures]]。有序对 $U_w=(\\mathfrak A_w^\\tau,<_{|w|})$ 的兼容输入类 $\\mathcal O_\\tau$、扩张 $E_\\tau$ 及词汇 $\\tau^\\uparrow$ 见 [[29-df-iterated-quantifier-block]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-iterated-quantifier-block","status":"resolved","id":"7174257cf5cba5d4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","l